\]

@end tex
@noindent
where @math{{h = (b - a)/n}}, for some even integer @math{n}, and
@math{y_k = {f(a + kh)}}.  (Increasing @math{n} increases the
accuracy of the approximation.)  Define a procedure that takes as arguments
